Title: Low Tide Radio teaser trailer
Credit: Written by
Author: OpenFrame evaluation fixture
Source: Low Tide Radio, a fictional film project
Draft date: 2027-01-10
Notes: Every person and place in this script is invented.

EXT. KADALPURAM BEACH - LOW TIDE - DAWN

Low tide. The rusted foot of the mast stands in wet sand. Anjali walks toward it, Mariamma far behind her.

ANJALI (V.O.)
Every coast has a voice. Ours was switched off for twenty years.

MARIAMMA
Some things are switched off for a reason.

INT. COAST RADIO STATION - TRANSMITTER ROOM - NIGHT

The valves warm from black to orange. Sudheesh keeps one hand on the switch.

SUDHEESH
Say something, Anjali.

ANJALI
This is Low Tide Radio.

EXT. COAST RADIO STATION - ROOF - NIGHT

Rain. Lamps appear one by one on the black water.

NANDAN
One, two, five, twenty! They are listening!

ANJALI
Then keep talking, Nandan.

